---
alwaysApply: false
---

- Do not compute stats; show selections only (showcase-first).
- Build config is JSON for v1; catalogs are normalized tables.
- Scrapers must be idempotent, cached, rate-limited, and use upserts.
- Charms in builds store target monsters as free-text arrays.
- Keep edits small; reference a spec in docs/ for every task.
